      "grade": "CONTEMPORARY_EVENT_REPORT_FULL_TEXT",
      "claims": "Second family hunting contest Dec 8–22 08:00: clan leader turns designated pets in to NPC; threshold 230 tasks for lottery; named top prizes 布里薩爾、巴特、奈坎特、哈沃斯. Also reports prior availability of 布里薩爾, all-water element and separate bingo green-ant and capsule water-buffalo prizes. No winner or issuance ledger."
    },
